  "description": "A set of stickers with beautiful olive branches and lemon is perfect for design. Also suitable for scrapbooks, planners, hand cutting, notebooks and more.\nThese files are compatible with all major cutting machines. And there are JPG files with outlines, so you can just print and cut by hand.\nINCLUDED:\nPNG file with transparent background with white stroke (A4; A5; letter size)\nPNG file with transparent background without stroke (A4; A5; letter size)\nJPG file with white background with white stroke (A4; A5; Letter size)\nJPG file with color background with white stroke (A4; A5; Letter size)\nAll files are ready to print with borders and outlines\nAll files 300 DPI.",
